ec9466d80bbb6facd327","node_id":"C_kwDOQPCwJdoAKGYzZjA0MzcyNzUxM2FiYTI2Y2UyZWM5NDY2ZDgwYmJiNmZhY2QzMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commit/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0","sha":"a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0"}],"sha":"f3f043727513aba26ce2ec9466d80bbb6facd327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/f3f043727513aba26ce2ec9466d80bbb6facd327"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T16:46:20Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T16:46:20Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"message":"🚀 Implement pipeline-based deployment with iterative testing\n\nPhase 1: SSL Certificate Management Pipeline\n- Create ssl-certificate-check.yml workflow\n- Automated certificate checking for both domains\n- Certificate generation using Cloudflare DNS-01 challenge\n- Auto-renewal configuration via certbot systemd timer\n- Runs daily at 2 AM UTC + manual trigger\n\nPhase 2: Enhanced Deployment Workflow\n- Add SSL pre-check job to deployment workflow\n- Update verification to test Traefik routing (port 8090)\n- Add nginx configuration trigger for server-cremati repo\n- Improved health checks and validation\n\nPhase 3: Iterative Testing Script\n- Create deploy-and-test-iteratively.js\n- Automated GitHub workflow triggering\n- Pipeline status monitoring (2-minute intervals)\n- Comprehensive Playwright tests:\n  * Login functionality\n  * MFE loading validation\n  * SSL certificate validation (both domains)\n  * API routing through Traefik\n- Detailed error reporting\n- Manual iteration workflow (fix → commit → run again)\n\nPhase 4: Integration\n- Add deploy:iterate npm script\n- Create scripts README documentation\n- Make script executable\n\nKey Features:\n- Zero manual server intervention (except SSL setup)\n- All nginx updates via server-cremati pipeline\n- Iterative testing until success\n- Maximum 10 iterations\n- Pipeline checks every 2 minutes\n- Success criteria: login + MFE + SSL + API routing\n\nUsage: npm run deploy:iterate","tree":{"sha":"83e01e09b97f955ab54657b43ab5b972e0dcbf95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/git/trees/83e01e09b97f955ab54657b43ab5b972e0dcbf95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/git/commits/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commit/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0","node_id":"C_kwDOQPCwJdoAKGEzZTU0ZThiMjFiZGFkYTY5ODQzYTU2YmEyOTFjNTc3MDc4ZjgxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commit/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a","sha":"8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a"}],"sha":"a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/a3e54e8b21bdada69843a56ba291c577078f81a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T15:21:51Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T15:21:51Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"message":"🔧 CRITICAL FIX: Use Traefik routing for API calls\n\n- Fix API URL detection to use Traefik routing (http://192.168.2.73:8090/api)\n- Instead of direct backend port (http://192.168.2.73:30001/api)\n- Update apiClient, AuthService, and ErrorLogger\n- This should fix all ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED errors for API calls","tree":{"sha":"cad7c6536894931f31205bec26556ed52bb9682e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/git/trees/cad7c6536894931f31205bec26556ed52bb9682e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/git/commits/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commit/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a","node_id":"C_kwDOQPCwJdoAKDhiYmViMmY0NGI1NGU1NjI4YmQ5MzA2NDhlZTU2YzBjNTU4MDNiN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commit/03af4db67d7651b99c8799f3c70517923d5caa0f","sha":"03af4db67d7651b99c8799f3c70517923d5caa0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/03af4db67d7651b99c8799f3c70517923d5caa0f"}],"sha":"8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/8bbeb2f44b54e5628bd930648ee56c0c55803b7a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/commits/03af4db67d7651b99c8799f3c70517923d5caa0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T14:58:24Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T14:58:24Z","email":"oudaykhaled@oudays-mbp.home","name":"Ouday Khaled"},"message":"🔧 Fix Module Federation remotes to use runtime dynamic URLs\n\n- Replace hardcoded REACT_APP_REMOTE_HOST with window.location.origin\n- Use promise-based remote loading for dynamic URL resolution\n- Remove hardcoded REACT_APP_API_URL from webpack DefinePlugin\n- Fix ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED errors for micro-frontend remotes","tree":{"sha":"375a1443dfa5ebd940d702d2fcbcc53295505bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yus-debug/cremat-sample/git/trees/375a1443dfa5eb