melessman80"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-08T04:40:04Z","email":"132729710+namelessman80@users.noreply.github.com","name":"namelessman80"},"message":"Optimize Policy Agent with Smart CAG context selection\n\nPerformance optimization for Pure CAG implementation:\n- Implemented intelligent policy selection based on query keywords\n- Reduces context size by 67-83% (from ~5,488 to ~900-2,000 words)\n- Maps keywords to specific policy documents:\n  * GDPR queries → GDPR policies only\n  * Privacy queries → Privacy policy\n  * Cookie queries → Cookie policy only\n  * Terms queries → Terms of service\n  * Falls back to all policies if no clear match\n\nResults from testing:\n- ''GDPR compliance?'' → 2/6 policies (GDPR docs)\n- ''Privacy policy?'' → 2/6 policies (Privacy related)\n- ''Cookie usage?'' → 1/6 policies (Cookie only)\n- ''Terms of service?'' → 2/6 policies (Terms related)\n\nExpected performance improvement: 3-5x faster response times\nMaintains Pure CAG architecture (no vector DB queries)","tree":{"sha":"159934c595e2ec398b8d261723ab406113a97cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namelessman80/advanced-customer-service-ai/git/trees/159934c595e2ec398b8d261723ab406113a97cfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namelessman80/advanced-customer-service-ai/git/commits/dac717dee9567d8197ca1d96c57458d4faef7efc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132729710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namelessman80","id":132729710,"login":"namelessman80","node_id":"U_kgDOB-lLbg","organizations_url":"https://ap