ers/namelessman80/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namelessman80","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namelessman80/advanced-customer-service-ai/commits/169916c1077507103f58581db824a8a9f2d50422/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-08T03:08:20Z","email":"132729710+namelessman80@users.noreply.github.com","name":"namelessman80"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-08T03:08:20Z","email":"132729710+namelessman80@users.noreply.github.com","name":"namelessman80"},"message":"Fix frontend git tracking and add all frontend source files\n\nPreviously frontend was incorrectly tracked as a git submodule.\nThis commit properly adds all frontend source code to the repository.\n\nFrontend Features:\n- Next.js 16 with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS\n- Real-time streaming chat interface with SSE\n- Component-based architecture:\n  - ChatInterface: Main container with state management\n  - MessageList: Conversation display with auto-scroll\n  - ChatInput: Message input with keyboard shortcuts\n  - AgentBadge: Visual agent type indicators\n  - ErrorMessage: User-friendly error handling\n  - LoadingIndicator: Typing animation\n- API client with streaming support (lib/api.ts)\n- Responsive design with dark mode support\n- Session management and context preservation\n\nRecent UI Improvements:\n- Optimized scroll performance to prevent freezing\n- Fixed input focus after sending messages\n- Simplified scroll implementation for reliability\n- Proper flex container hierarchy for overflow handling","tree":{"sha":"2a24dc7fe956064cdf16c2f3bd4a9ba605ac28f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namelessman80/advanced-customer-service-ai/git/trees/2a24dc7fe956064cdf16c2f3bd4