https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/0aa89f4811102295b86f6f5e6540dcd80c916b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:29:20Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:29:20Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat: failsafe cruce de día local ante cambio de hora\n\n- vendedorApp/timezone_guard: detecta registros de dinero (venta, anulación,\n  devolución) cuya fecha UTC difiere de la fecha local Santiago; log WARNING\n  sin bloquear ni alterar datos. La frontera (20:00 invierno / 21:00 verano)\n  se adapta sola al DST.\n- hooks en venta directa, venta de pedido, anulación y ambas devoluciones.\n- cierre de caja expone cruce_dia (total + detalle) y la UI muestra aviso\n  cuando el cierre contiene documentos del día local anterior.\n- comando audit_cruce_fecha: audita el histórico, exit 1 si encuentra cruces.\n- tests: fronteras DST invierno/verano, warning por venta tardía, cruce en\n  cierre y comportamiento del comando.\n- docs: sección 7.6 en guia-tecnica con la convención de fechas.","tree":{"sha":"4888b126d5a37f23ff9fd2f550610f4ba6a6108d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/4888b126d5a37f23ff9fd2f550610f4ba6a6108d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/0aa89f4811102295b86f6f5e6540dcd80c916b3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https:/