:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T15:45:03Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat: Configuración 2.0 (tema + config de tienda) y ventas resilientes en UI 1.26\n\n- Configuración: port del selector de esquemas de color (para todos los roles) y del formulario completo de tienda (moneda/locale, impuestos/redondeo, despacho/margen, medios de pago, documentos) restringido a Encargado/Gerente; Vendedor/Bodeguero ven solo el tema.\n- theme.js 2.0 (COLOR_SCHEMES/applyScheme) + bloques [data-scheme] y estilos .scheme-* aditivos en design-system.css (se conserva el look 1.26).\n- api.js 2.0 (ApiError, timeouts, retryable, redirectToLogin idempotente).\n- VentaPage 1.26: ventas resilientes (idempotencia_key, reintentos con backoff, verificación por clave, banners offline/reintento/verificación).\n- queries.js: useStoreConfig acepta { enabled }.","tree":{"sha":"b44765b576f54d09f37ee7c0a7e99bb96655f5e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/b44765b576f54d09f37ee7c0a7e99bb96655f5e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/d0469b5df311ee5b7e60f848644508af3b89db88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us