acy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/85687039af9fc21e4894a6af7ac660991f49445d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:39:05Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:39:05Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat(ui): ajustes del rediseño — sidebar legacy, overlay del POS y botones redondeados\n\n- Sidebar: botones de navegación con look previo (iconos Bootstrap, raíl de acento, sin chip), nombre de la tienda junto a la versión, y colapso conservando iconos.\n- POS: resultados de búsqueda como overlay sobre el carrito (eje z), con altura acotada y botón Cerrar; vista por defecto en lista persistida por terminal (localStorage).\n- Escala de radios unificada en @theme (lg 16px, xl 20px, 2xl 24px) eliminando la colisión con design-system.css; botones, inputs, modales y tarjetas del lenguaje nuevo con más redondez.\n- Fix: text-text-primary corrompido a text-text-accent (clase inexistente) por el reemplazo previo.","tree":{"sha":"a9e1f59ad1dc1fba198e02948ad78097d4df4445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/a9e1f59ad1dc1fba198