following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/96c4e4b6e89c4c4bc32927941b616c81acaecb35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:38:55Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:38:55Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"fix(venta): stock sin ubicación duplicado rompía el descuento\n\n- Columna generada ubicacion_key = COALESCE(ubicacion_id, 0) con unique_together (producto, ubicacion_key): en MariaDB un índice UNIQUE no cubre NULL, por lo que podían existir varias filas ''sin ubicación'' por producto.\n- Migración que fusiona los duplicados (suma cantidad en la fila de menor id y reapunta stock_historico) antes de crear el índice único.\n- UbicacionViewSet.destroy: suma el stock de la ubicación eliminada a la fila ''sin ubicación'' para no chocar con la nueva constraint.\n- Tests: deducción con ubicacion_id null y bloqueo de duplicados.","tree":{"sha":"ddc9b032e15dbc95f24a6cf33e75c8e84c32d376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/ddc9b032e15dbc95f24a6cf33e75c8e84c32d376"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/96c4e4b6e89c4c4bc32927941b616c81acaecb35","verification":{"payloa