","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/6dfe93c1419e855c7b554833424544187225d98f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:06:58Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:06:58Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat(ui): rediseño Stitch con Tailwind v4 — Shell, POS y Dashboard\n\n- Infraestructura del sistema de diseño: Tailwind CSS v4 + @tailwindcss/vite, fuentes (DM Sans/Syne/JetBrains Mono) y Material Symbols en index.html.\n- Tokens @theme mapeados a las variables de design-system.css para que el tema claro/oscuro y los esquemas de color seleccionables sigan funcionando; tokens Stitch (secondary-container, surface-container, etc.) estáticos.\n- Shell rediseñado: sidebar colapsable agrupada por rol (Operaciones/Bodega/Administración), botón Nueva Venta, topbar glassmorphism con título dinámico, novedades, tema y perfil.\n- VentaPage: POS de 2 columnas (catálogo tarjeta/tabla + gaveta de checkout sticky), descuento con stepper, desglose Neto/IVA, pagos mixtos, impresión, modal de deducción por ubicación (simple o mixto). Conserva medios/documentos configurables, feature flags, idempotencia y reintentos.\n- Dashboard: 4 stat cards, tabla por vendedor, alertas de stock con paginación y acciones rápidas, popover de alternativas OEM y tarjeta de Novedades. Conserva formato monetario configurable, feature flags y mutaciones optimistas.\n- Hybrid-gradual: el resto de pantallas conserva el diseño previo (ver DESIGN.md).","tree":{"sha":"b92a195915d0e17189b7a797ac02504010cce34a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/b92a195915d0e17189b7a797ac02504010cce34a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/6dfe93c1419e855c7b554833424544187225d98f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/6dfe93c1419e855c7b554833424544187225d98f","node_id":"C_kwDOQPMD6NoAKDZkZmU5M2MxNDE5ZTg1NWM3YjU1NDgzMzQyNDU0NDE4NzIyNWQ5OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955","sha":"b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955"}],"sha":"6dfe93c1419e855c7b554833424544187225d98f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/6dfe93c1419e855c7b554833424544187225d98f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:06:44Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:06:44Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat(venta): ventas resilientes ante cortes de conexión\n\n- Clave única de idempotencia por venta (campo idempotencia_key + endpoint /ventas/por-clave/) que evita duplicados y números de comprobante repetidos.\n- Reintento automático (hasta 4 veces con espera progresiva) ante errores de red o 5xx, con verificación previa por clave.\n- Banner de verificación manual cuando la respuesta se pierde, y aviso de estado offline con carrito persistente.\n- Cliente API con ApiError (kind/retryable), timeouts por solicitud y reintento tras renovar token.\n- Validación previa en anulación/devolución y ajuste de stock para no dejar el proceso a medias; mensaje claro al vender un producto inexistente.\n- Fix: evitar recarga infinita en /login cuando la sesión expira (redirectToLogin idempotente).","tree":{"sha":"fa27e8511705e54dfab833529eae033a4a6b2561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/fa27e8511705e54dfab833529eae033a4a6b2561"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955","node_id":"C_kwDOQPMD6NoAKGI5YTUwOTcyM2MwZmM2Yzk4ODc1ZmQyODUzZGM5Njk2NTE5MTM5NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/9be8aa8dc052b09a86599450eb4639213670044b","sha":"9be8aa8dc052b09a86599450eb4639213670044b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/9be8aa8dc052b09a86599450eb4639213670044b"}],"sha":"b9a509723c0fc6c98875fd2853dc969651913955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/