tps://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commits/9b69e12a2bef1417c67db4a7a451597817097557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:17:18Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:17:18Z","email":"contacto@bazaes.cl","name":"Nicolás Bazaes"},"message":"feat(config): dynamic payment/docs, extension seam, config-driven shipping (phase 2)\n\n- Extension seam for store-specific order-line cost modifiers:\n  gerenteApp/store_extensions/ registry + stellantis.py (EUROCAS-only,\n  20% discount). PedidoDetalle.stellantis bool -> cost_modifiers JSON\n  (data migration moves stellantis=True -> [\"stellantis\"])\n- Pedido.costo_envio default 4500 -> 0; create paths default from\n  StoreConfig.default_shipping_cost\n- StoreConfig.payment_methods/document_types JSON lists (with active flags)\n  exposed via /api/configuracion/ (raw + effective_*); serializers validate\n  codes against active config; VentaPage/PedidosCrearPage render options\n  from config; ConfiguracionPage gets a list editor\n- Cierre de caja dynamic: calcular_cierre/historial pivot by active\n  methods/docs keyed by code, CierreCaja.desglose JSON snapshot (legacy\n  columns kept), detail-view valid claves from config\n- Data migration enables feature_flags.order_pricing_rules for existing\n  installs (gates the cost-modifier checkbox UI)","tree":{"sha":"a732f47876c642bfc665655e43b6f54ef6332eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/a732f47876c642bfc665655e43b6f54ef6332eac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/9b69e12a2bef1417c67db4a7a451597817097557","verif