es"},"message":"feat(pedidos): retiro con stock negativo, resolución por identidad y reconciliación en factura\n\n- _descontar_stock_pedido re-resuelve el producto por identidad (auto-cura de\n  FKs incoherentes) y permite stock negativo en la ubicación por defecto.\n- CrearPedidoSerializer vincula el detalle al producto que matchea el código\n  del ítem, no al producto_id enviado.\n- FacturaViewSet detecta coincidencias con pedidos custom ya retirados y\n  expone /reconciliar-pedidos/ para vincular y descontar.\n- Frontend: modal de reconciliación con checkbox al ingresar factura y\n  re-vínculo de producto_id al editar código en PedidosCrearPage.","tree":{"sha":"0b6c8e6819c2916eefd16e4dbb250ccd44287fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/0b6c8e6819c2916eefd16e4dbb250ccd44287fea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/edd185793e304d582dd29f691e5974508f9ca6ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c