mites de memoria y tuning MariaDB para VPS 1 GiB + auditoria de queries N+1\n\n- mem_limit en compose: db 448m, app 320m, nginx 64m\n- config MariaDB en docker/mariadb/zz-bazpos-tuning.cnf (buffer pool 128M, max_connections 30)\n- gunicorn a 2 workers sync con --max-requests 500+-50\n- nuevo comando profile_endpoints (auditoria N+1, funciona con DEBUG=False)\n- fix N+1 en ProductoSerializer.ubicaciones_stock y PedidoProveedorDiaHistorialSerializer (reuso del prefetch cache)\n- deploy-stack.sh sincroniza docker/mariadb/ a la VM (el mount lo requiere)","tree":{"sha":"aca7f6fe552e55e832ac49b7bf34e0430b9ba3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/aca7f6fe552e55e832ac49b7bf34e0430b9ba3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/f9e0c1147ff7bad5856c883d4a062b598af88e1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/f9e0c1147ff7bad5856c883d4a062b598af88e1f","node_id":"C_kwDOQPMD6NoAKG