 de columnas\n  y filtros, paginado y exportable a CSV.\n- Reporte de productos con filtro ''Stock al dia'': las columnas de stock\n  (total y por ubicacion) muestran el stock a una fecha dada.\n- Modelo StockHistorico (3NF) que registra cada cambio real de stock via\n  senal post_save, referenciando la fila de stock exacta.\n- Comando seed_stock_historico para poblar historial sintetico de prueba.\n- Reporte personalizado como pestana dentro de Reportes.\n- Tests backend (137 OK) y frontend lint/build limpios.","tree":{"sha":"470ed7c42cfa388260aadcc1a11f50ee116d12b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/trees/470ed7c42cfa388260aadcc1a11f50ee116d12b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nbazaes/django-bazpos/git/commits/decbd3e9c983da6894c83df10b39a035e8699137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167266564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes","id":167266564,"login":"nbazaes","node_id":"U_kgDOCfhJBA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbazaes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nbazaes/django-bazpos/commit/decbd3e9c983da6894c83df10b39a035e8699137","node_id":"C_kwDOQPMD6NoAKGRlY2JkM2U5Yzk4M2RhNjg5NGM4M2RmMTBiMzlhM