":"feat: Add Lab Validation tab to display device output transcripts\n\nAdd a new \"Lab Validation\" tab that shows validation results and device\noutput transcripts from the validator agent. The tab displays:\n- Validation summary (pass/fail, duration, steps passed)\n- Device output transcripts in terminal-style format\n- Auto-switches to validation tab when results become available\n\nChanges:\n- Add LabValidationTab component with terminal-style transcript display\n- Update ContentTabNavigation to include validation tab\n- Add device_outputs field to ValidationResult type\n- Update lab detail page to render validation content\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba80cd7734fe83377595d0d8f95a5d5e766f5ec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/ba80cd7734fe83377595d0d8f95a5d5e766f5ec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/9a9c99b10c2ac6b3d3e8a8843f35786d903b1a0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subs