ail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Use correct prompt for each command in validation transcript\n\nThe prompt field in transcript.json shows the state AFTER command execution,\nnot before. Updated to track previous prompt for each device and use it when\nformatting command lines.\n\nNow shows correct sequence:\n  R1#enable\n  R1#configure terminal\n  R1(config)#hostname R1\n\nInstead of incorrect:\n  R1#enable\n  R1(config)#configure terminal  (wrong prompt)\n  R1(config)#hostname R1\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a94dc8f444006dd9b4248c0f7fd7be8b9410082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/6a94dc8f444006dd9b4248c0f7fd7be8b9410082"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/4502a85ba91a83f66648da4b5034c947a82b4bde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4502a85ba91a83f66648da4b5034c947a82b4bde","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDQ1MDJhODViYTkxYTgzZjY2NjQ4ZGE0YjUwMzRjOTQ3YTgyYjRiZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/1d1559eef0610e100b77e69dba60ec6935cf89c9","sha":"1d1559eef0610e100b77e69dba60ec6935cf89c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/1d1559eef0610e100b77e69dba60ec6935cf89c9"}],"sha":"4502a85ba91a83f66648da4b5034c947a82b4bde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4502a85ba91a83f66648da4b5034c947a82b4bde"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/1d1559eef0610e100b77e69dba60ec6935cf89c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T13:52:57Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T13:52:57Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Fetch validation transcript from transcript.json instead of devices/\n\nThe headless-runner writes validation output to transcript.json (a JSON array\nof command/response pairs), not to individual device files in devices/ subdirectory.\n\nUpdated fetch_validation_artifacts() to:\n- Fetch and parse transcript.json\n- Group entries by device\n- Format as readable text transcripts (device_transcript.txt)\n- Fallback to old devices/ format for backward compatibility\n\nThis fixes the missing device_outputs and validation transcript in API responses.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1bc69360857af93246cf633f699a245f09201d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/e1bc69360857af93246cf633f699a245f09201d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/1d1559eef0610e100b77e69dba60ec6935cf89c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/1d155