e":"2025-11-10T06:10:27Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T06:10:27Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Install gcloud CLI in Docker container for validation\n\nThe validator agent calls ''gcloud run jobs execute'' to submit validation\njobs, but gcloud was not installed in the container, causing:\n''[Errno 2] No such file or directory: gcloud''\n\nChanges:\n- Added curl, apt-transport-https, ca-certificates, gnupg to dependencies\n- Added Google Cloud SDK repository\n- Installed google-cloud-cli package\n\nThis allows the orchestrator to submit Cloud Run Jobs for lab validation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d7bd1cec20b62932ffce609ff027bc759414c02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/2d7bd1cec20b62932ffce609ff027bc759414c02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/b97f92e5f3704afd8d2ceb9828957c0b546b30ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri