b66f3d289886e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T05:40:26Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T05:40:26Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Correct validation success detection to support headless runner format\n\nThe ValidationArtifacts.success property was only checking for\nsummary.status == \"PASS\", but the headless runner actually returns\nsummary.ok == true with no \"status\" field at all.\n\nThis caused successful validations to be marked as failed, showing\n\"Validation found some issues\" even when the summary said\n\"ok: true, summary: no errors detected\".\n\nUpdated the success property to check both formats:\n- Old format: summary.status == \"PASS\"\n- Current format: summary.ok == true\n\nThis ensures validation success is correctly detected regardless of\nwhich format the headless runner uses.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0128e4a264d374c12c4bab02a28285959bdabf78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/0128e4a264d374c12c4bab02a28285959bdabf78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/edf1a51d46be2b0ef44eebd855b66f3d289886e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos