ttps://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/011a23506e7d2bcb2526ba8a151f640e0f2898e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T04:54:05Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T04:54:05Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Pass exercise_spec to Designer via message and copy outputs before status\n\nThis commit fixes the multi-turn chat issue where Designer/Author agents\ncouldn''t access exercise_spec from session state, and outputs weren''t\navailable in status responses.\n\nRoot cause: ADK agents can''t read from session.state - they can only read\nfrom conversation messages and write to session.state via output_key.\n\nChanges:\n1. Pass exercise_spec as JSON in Designer''s user message instead of\n   relying on agent reading from session.state\n2. Copy design_output to labs dict BEFORE setting designer_complete status\n3. Copy draft_lab_guide to labs dict BEFORE setting author_complete status\n\nThis ensures frontend receives outputs in designer_complete and\nauthor_complete status responses, not just in the final completed status.\n\nTested with lab_1762750191 - Designer/Author now produce full outputs.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e12aef10a55ee05004d303b41fe5e34add1d379a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/e12aef10a55ee05004d303b41fe5e34add1d379a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/011a23506e7d2bcb2526ba8a151f640e0f2898e0","verification":{"pay