m/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/bb68d3b6069020869f76ffcb7b389bf7f1c7b9d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T02:24:23Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T02:24:23Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Remove redundant progress messages and fix message classification\n\nBackend now sends detailed status messages in chat, making our completion\nmessages redundant. Simplified to show only \"running\" stage indicators:\n- ⏳ Designing network topology...\n- ⏳ Writing lab guide...\n- ⏳ Validating lab exercise...\n\nRemoved redundant completion messages:\n- ✓ Requirements gathered\n- ✓ Network designed\n- ✓ Lab guide written\n- ✓ Validation complete\n- ✓ Lab generation completed successfully!\n\nAlso fixed message classification - backend Planner messages were incorrectly\nbeing rendered as \"Progress Update\" bubbles due to content-based detection\n(checking for keywords like \"designing\", \"writing\"). Now only messages from\nlocal progress tracking (identified by timestamp) are rendered as blue\n\"Progress Update\" bubbles. All backend messages correctly appear as gray\n\"Planner\" messages.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"328aeee8b516a2b5033b6ad09430bb068d3fd140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/328aeee8b516a2b5033b6ad09430bb068d3fd140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/bb68d3b6069020869f76ffcb7b389bf7f1c7b9d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/bb68d3b6069020869f76ffcb7b389bf7f1c7b9d3","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKGJiNjhkM2I2MDY5MDIwODY5Zjc2ZmZjYjdiMzg5YmY3ZjFjN2I5ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233","sha":"27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233"}],"sha":"bb68d3b6069020869f76ffcb7b389bf7f1c7b9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/bb68d3b6069020869f76ffcb7b389bf7f1c7b9d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T02:06:22Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T02:06:22Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Store progress messages in local memory for immediate visibility\n\nFixed issue where canned progress messages weren''t appearing in the conversation\nuntil a user sent a message to the Planner agent.\n\nRoot cause:\n- Progress messages were being appended to ADK session using append_event()\n- These events weren''t persisted to storage until an agent actually ran\n- The /status endpoint fetched session from storage, which didn''t have the messages yet\n- Messages only appeared after Planner agent ran (triggered by user chat), which synced\n  all pending events to storage\n\nSolution:\n- Added progress_messages list to lab dictionary for local storage\n- Modified send_progress_update() to store messages locally instead of ADK session\n- Updated /status endpoint to merge local progress_messages with ADK session events\n- Applied fix to both run_pipeline() (OLD flow) and run_generation_pipeline() (NEW flow)\n\nChanges:\n- Line 149: Added progress_messages field to lab initialization\n- Lines 642-654: Added send_progress_update() helper to run_pipeline()\n- Lines 665, 705, 754: Added progress message calls at each pipeline stage\n- Lines 792-799: Added final success/failure/dry-run messages\n- Lines 808-827: Modified send_progress_update() in run_generation_pipeline()\n- Lines 262-277: Updated /status endpoint to merge and sort messages\n\nResult:\nProgress messages now appear immediately in /status endpoint without requiring\nuser interaction, providing real-time feedback during lab generation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2aee34a6b8f39611ffa8361048c698de1de4ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/f2aee34a6b8f39611ffa8361048c698de1de4ed5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDI3Zjc5N2FjMTNhNzY3Mzc1YmIzOWFkNTVjZGM5ZTk1YTI0YmEyMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701","sha":"4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701"}],"sha":"27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/27f797ac13a767375bb39ad55cdc9e95a24ba233"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T01:19:26Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T01:19:26Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Correct invalid ISO 8601 timestamp format in conversation messages\n\nFixed issue where timestamps were being sent as `2025-11-10T00:56:09.108621+00:00Z`\nwhich is invalid ISO 8601 format (cannot have both timezone offset AND Z suffix).\n\nRoot cause:\n- Line 210 converted created_at to timezone-aware datetime using +00:00\n- Line 247 then added ''Z'' suffix to the already timezone-aware datetime\n- Result: Invalid format with both offset and Z suffix\n\nFix:\n- Changed line 210 to keep base_time as naive datetime (no timezone info)\n- Now message_time.isoformat() + ''Z'' produces valid format: 2025-11-10T00:56:09.108621Z\n\nThis resolves \"Invalid Date\" display issues in the frontend.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b71d094b7f0f36da5a0fdd323e7422bf4f93cff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/b71d094b7f0f36da5a0fdd323e7422bf4f93cff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDQ1NzQ0MDJiODNkYTk5MzNkOTEzYzRlMDJkODQwNThjNDZmNGY3MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d","sha":"94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d"}],"sha":"4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4574402b83da9933d913c4e02d84058c46f4f701"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T01:12:53Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T01:12:53Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Run agents separately and add delays for visible status transitions\n\nThis commit fixes the missing intermediate status updates (author_running)\nby changing the generation pipeline execution strategy.\n\nChanges:\n- Replace SequentialAgent with separate Runner instances for each agent\n- Run Designer, Author, and Validator individually with status updates between each\n- Increase status transition delays from 0.5s to 2.0s for frontend polling\n- Add 1s delay after setting author_running to ensure visibility\n\nThis ensures all status transitions are visible in the frontend:\n- designer_running → designer_complete → author_running → author_complete\n- validator_running → validator_complete → completed\n\nThe separate execution approach matches the old run_pipeline() behavior\nwhich was working correctly before the refactor.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ead7852a4094448577726997c0ebe7fbb7d622b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/ead7852a4094448577726997c0ebe7fbb7d622b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDk0ZDgzMTNkMWU2MzI4MjUwNDc2MzRjZjI1ODUzOTMzNjc1MzBiMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686","sha":"bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686"}],"sha":"94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/94d8313d1e632825047634cf2585393367530b1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T00:59:35Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T00:59:35Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Add explicit UTC timezone markers and filter internal messages from conversation\n\nThis commit fixes timestamp interpretation issues and cleans up the\nconversation history returned by the /api/labs/{lab_id}/status endpoint.\n\nChanges:\n- Add utc_now() helper function that appends ''Z'' suffix to all timestamps\n- Replace all datetime.utcnow().isoformat() calls with utc_now()\n- Modify status endpoint to fetch conversation from ADK session.events\n- Filter out internal messages from conversation:\n  * \"start\"/\"generate\" trigger messages\n  * Validation failure messages with execution IDs\n  * Markdown-wrapped duplicate content (messages starting with ```)\n\nThis ensures:\n- Frontend correctly interprets timestamps as UTC (not local time)\n- Conversation only shows user-facing messages\n- Messages appear in correct chronological order\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6911d54fc027b26e24062e6b9e5acfc747e2ad77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/6911d54fc027b26e24062e6b9e5acfc747e2ad77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKGJjMDQxYzIzZmU3ODI0YmIwNjg4NGU3NDU0MzdjYjk1MGIyYjU2ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/915e0600279dd5872142c62c12515c8c7453955d","sha":"915e0600279dd5872142c62c12515c8c7453955d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/915e0600279dd5872142c62c12515c8c7453955d"}],"sha":"bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/bc041c23fe7824bb06884e745437cb950b2b5686"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/915e0600279dd5872142c62c12515c8c7453955d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T00:51:52Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-10T00:51:52Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"feat: Render Exercise Spec and progress updates inline in chat history\n\nMajor changes to chat message rendering:\n- Exercise Spec now renders as green bubble inline with messages at correct\n  chronological position instead of separate section\n- Progress updates (Requirements gathered, Network designed, Lab guide written,\n  Validation complete) now render as individual blue bubbles in chat history\n- Progress updates generated from status changes and merged into message stream\n- All messages sorted by timestamp for proper chronological order\n- Added markdown rendering for Planner assistant messages\n\nBug fixes:\n- Fixed LabDesignTab crash when platforms is undefined\n- Fixed text contrast in progress update bubbles (now text-gray-900)\n\nThe chat now shows a complete chronological history with user messages,\nplanner responses, exercise specs, and progress updates all interleaved\nin the correct order.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c4ca38caa218f03696ead7c1c759bcac6de6803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/5c4ca38caa218f03696ead7c1c759bcac6de6803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/915e0600279dd5872142c62c12515c8c7453955d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racam