campos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/b3b440f6becea45bef90351d6fc4e4f0293af2fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T23:09:06Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T23:09:06Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Resolve chat message persistence and ordering issues\n\nFixes several critical issues with the Planner chat functionality:\n\nMessage Persistence:\n- Implement optimistic updates to show user messages immediately\n- Add conversation merging in polling hook to preserve local messages\n- Prevent server polling from overwriting optimistic updates\n- Remove immediate query invalidation after chat submission\n\nMessage Display:\n- Filter out raw JSON exercise_spec from conversation messages\n- Only show formatted Exercise Spec badge (green box)\n- Parse backend response correctly (exercise_spec field contains text)\n\nMessage Ordering:\n- Remove timestamp-based sorting to avoid timezone issues\n- Trust server message order + append local-only messages\n- Prevents messages from appearing out of chronological order\n\nImplementation Details:\n- useChatWithPlanner: onMutate adds user message optimistically\n- useChatWithPlanner: onSuccess adds Planner response to local state\n- useLabPolling: merges server + local conversations intelligently\n- PlannerChatPanel: filters messages containing JSON structure\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bcd8598fc818caa721442c026d39127ea24f732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/1bcd8598fc818caa721442c026d39127ea24f732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/b3b440f6becea45bef90351d6fc4e4f0293af2fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verif