ml_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/d085cd514881e6e72b1c30ac474f20d55c01286c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T22:49:18Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T22:49:18Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"refactor: Implement new architecture with always-on Planner (WIP)\n\nThis is a first implementation of the new backend architecture where\nthe Planner agent is always available throughout the lab creation process.\n\nMajor Changes:\n- NEW 2-panel layout: Content area (2/3) + Always-on Planner chat (1/3)\n- Simplified to 2 content tabs: \"Lab Design\" and \"Lab Guide\"\n- Planner chat panel with embedded progress indicator\n- Exercise Spec shown as formatted message in chat\n- Validation banner in Lab Guide tab\n- New /chat endpoint integration (chatWithPlanner API)\n- Support for latest_planner_update polling and injection\n\nComponents:\n- PlannerChatPanel: Always-on chat with embedded progress\n- ContentTabNavigation: Simple 2-tab system\n- LabDesignTab: Topology and configurations\n- LabGuideTab: Markdown guide with validation banner\n\nAPI Updates:\n- chatWithPlanner() function for new /chat endpoint\n- useChatWithPlanner() hook\n- Updated Lab type with latest_planner_update field\n- New ChatRequest/ChatResponse types\n\nKnown Issues (to be addressed in subsequent commits):\n- Minor UI alignment and spacing issues\n- Progress indicator timing needs refinement\n- Auto-tab switching edge cases\n- Chat message formatting adjustments\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6157955a7e047f686be859f37e8723e0d91c7fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/d6157955a7e047f686be859f37e8723e0d91c7fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/d085cd514881e6e72b1c30ac474f20d55c01286c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/d085cd514881e6e72b1c30ac474f20d55c01286c","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKGQwODVjZDUxNDg4MWU2ZTcyYjFjMzBhYzQ3NGYyMGQ1NWMwMTI4NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/1e7056c3597af2eaa25b4ebe401e95250654a58d","sha":"1e7056c3597af2eaa25b4ebe401e95250654a58d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/1e7056c3597af2eaa25b4ebe401e95250654a58d"}],"sha":"d085cd514881e6e72b1c30ac474f20d55c01286c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/d085cd514881e6e72b1c30ac474f20d55c01286c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/1e7056c3597af2eaa25b4ebe401e95250654a58d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T22:30:32Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T22:30:32Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"feat: Implement new architecture with separate Planner chat and auto-trigger\n\nMajor refactor to decouple Planner from generation pipeline:\n\n## New Endpoints\n- POST /api/labs/{lab_id}/chat - Interactive Planner conversation\n  - Returns done=true when exercise_spec ready\n  - Auto-triggers generation pipeline in background\n- POST /api/labs/{lab_id}/generate - Manual generation trigger (optional)\n\n## New Pipeline Function\n- create_generation_pipeline() in pipeline.py\n  - Starts from Designer (assumes exercise_spec exists)\n  - Pipeline: Designer → Author → Validator\n  - No Planner dependency\n\n## Progress Messages via Planner\n- Canned progress messages injected into Planner conversation\n- Uses ADK''s append_event() to add messages to session.events\n- Frontend polls latest_planner_update field for new messages\n- Messages appear as if Planner said them, maintaining context\n\n## Key Features\n- Planner runs independently with own Runner\n- Generation auto-starts when Planner completes (done=true)\n- Progress updates show in chat interface\n- Full conversation history preserved in ADK session.events\n- Shared session state (session_id = lab_id)\n\n## Backend Changes\n- api_server.py: Added chat endpoint, generation trigger, progress injection\n- pipeline.py: Added create_generation_pipeline() for Planner-less execution\n- NEW_ARCHITECTURE.md: Complete technical documentation for frontend\n\nStage 1 complete (no RCA yet). Ready for frontend implementation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c0b7dd5e0a89c3a87bdab847156c1ada676f67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/7c0b7dd5e0a89c3a87bdab847156c1ada676f67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/1e7056c3597af2eaa25b4ebe401e95250654a58d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co