om/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/d6b55288cca885ea4a27bcf284a671e6232a3133/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T21:17:28Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T21:17:28Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Improve validation_result persistence in API server\n\nChanges:\n- Add global _session_service instance to share session state across requests\n- Store validation_result in validator_agent.last_validation_result instance variable\n- Add on-demand fetching of validation_result in get_lab_status endpoint\n- Refactor validator event creation to explicitly write to session state before yielding\n\nThis fixes the issue where validation_result was null in API responses even\nafter validation completed. The validator now stores results in an instance\nvariable that can be accessed after the agent run completes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd2e24b2b08f758c276d87d770b16b6a1a7004cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/dd2e24b2b08f758c276d87d770b16b6a1a7004cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/d6b55288cca885ea4a27bcf284a671e6232a3133","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html