l":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4cfefe038fb1b278bb92d296975f07725131f989/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T20:29:05Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T20:29:05Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"refactor: Redesign UI with enhanced tabbed stage interface\n\nMajor UI overhaul to improve lab creation and progress visualization:\n\nTab Navigation Enhancements:\n- Increase tab size with larger circles (8x8) and text (base)\n- Add horizontal connecting lines between tabs showing progress flow\n- Lines turn green when left tab completes (visual flow indicator)\n- Thicker bottom border (4px) for better active tab visibility\n- Tabs show gray/yellow/green status with spinners\n\nProgress Tracking:\n- Remove separate horizontal progress tracker component\n- Progress now shown entirely through enhanced tab navigation\n- Cleaner, more streamlined single-source-of-truth for progress\n\nTab Content Components:\n- PlannerTab: Conversation UI + Exercise Spec\n- DesignerTab: Topology, devices, and configurations\n- AuthorTab: Lab guide markdown with formatting\n- ValidatorTab: Validation results and artifacts\n\nCreate Page Redesign:\n- Redesign /create to look like Planner tab interface\n- Show tab navigation with only Planner active\n- Chat-style welcome message from Planner Agent\n- Example prompts as clickable suggestion buttons\n- Seamless flow from creation to lab detail page\n\nFull-Width Layout:\n- Remove sidebar layout from lab detail page\n- All content flows full-width for better readability\n- Auto-switching to newly enabled tabs as stages complete\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tr