.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/7860663ba72d4f0f07e45dc668616e717c896c04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-08T22:55:31Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-08T22:55:31Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"refactor: Simplify Lab Guide to use markdown rendering\n\nReplaced complex JSON parsing logic with simple markdown rendering\nusing the new draft_lab_guide_markdown field from the backend API.\n\nChanges:\n- Updated Lab interface to include draft_lab_guide_markdown field\n- Completely rewrote GuidePanel component (233 lines → 31 lines!)\n- Now accepts markdown string instead of DraftLabGuide object\n- Uses ReactMarkdown for rendering with Tailwind prose styling\n- Removed all manual JSON parsing and HTML generation\n- Maintained dark text colors for accessibility\n- Updated lab detail page to pass markdown to GuidePanel\n\nBenefits:\n- 87% reduction in component code (233 → 31 lines)\n- Simpler maintenance - backend owns formatting logic\n- Better consistency - markdown rendered uniformly\n- Easier to update - just style the prose classes\n- No more missing sections or rendering bugs\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b59199111586859e84d5100223cdd7954287554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/4b59199111586859e84d5100223cdd7954287554"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/7860663ba72d4f0f07e45dc668616e717c896c04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{