po}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/207da3e8c1c723c1e6c4f1bba2ed70f36afeafdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-08T22:33:09Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-08T22:33:09Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"feat: Add interactive Planner conversation support to frontend\n\nThis commit implements the interactive Planner conversation feature based on BACKEND_REQUIREMENTS_V2.md, allowing real-time collaboration between instructors and the AI Planner agent.\n\nChanges:\n- Added ConversationPanel component for chat-style UI with message history\n- Updated types to support conversation messages and awaiting_user_input status\n- Added sendMessage API endpoint and React Query hook for sending messages\n- Modified createLab to initialize conversation with initial prompt\n- Updated lab detail page to show conversation panel during Planner phase\n- Added purple badge styling for awaiting_user_input status\n- Fixed GuidePanel null safety checks for device_sections and steps arrays\n- Removed old non-interactive pipeline simulation logic\n\nBackend integration:\n- Frontend now expects conversation.messages array in lab status\n- Supports multi-turn conversation loop with Planner\n- Automatically transitions to review panels after Planner completes\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added BACKEND_REQUIREMENTS_V2.md with complete API specification\n- Added BACKEND_API_REVIEW.md with backend team feedback\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89295948461479f7ebf6ceb10517a84fafe1ff75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/89295948461479f7ebf6ceb10517a84fa