\n  - `--mock-objectives-error`: Tests spec issues (Planner errors)\n\n- Update ValidatorAgent to accept mock_mode: str parameter\n- Create realistic mock scenarios for each error type\n- Add test script for all three mock modes\n- Document technical debt: mock format doesn''t match real headless-runner output\n\nFiles changed:\n- orchestrator/adk_agents/validator.py: Implement three mock scenarios\n- orchestrator/adk_agents/pipeline.py: Update to use mock_mode parameter\n- orchestrator/test_mock_modes.sh: Test script for all three modes\n- TECHNICAL_DEBT.md: Document mock format mismatch issue\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa803ad4603531cc9c3f3beb21322f8866f58fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/aa803ad4603531cc9c3f3beb21322f8866f58fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/d34562db47ba6222f731cafcd1b2f847ba8e020d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"htt