w\n\nThis commit fixes the state persistence issue between the Validator\nand RCA agents by implementing ADK''s Event-yielding pattern and\ncorrect placeholder injection.\n\nChanges:\n- validator.py: Add Event-yielding for all 8 return paths\n  * Created _yield_validation_event() helper method\n  * Store validation_result_json in context.session.state\n  * Fixed Part API usage (Part(text=...) not Part.from_text())\n\n- rca.py: Fix placeholder injection for both agents\n  * RCAAgent uses {validation_result_json?} placeholder\n  * PatchRouterAgent uses {patch_plan?} placeholder\n  * Both agents parse complete JSON objects\n\n- main_adk.py: Start three-flag mock approach (partial)\n  * Add --mock-design-error, --mock-instruction-error, --mock-objectives-error\n  * Replace single --mock-validation-failure boolean\n  * Auto-set password lab prompt for consistent testing\n  * Change parameter from bool to string mock_mode\n\nNote: Three-flag implementation is incomplete. pipeline.py and\nvalidator.py still need updates to support the new mock_mode parameter.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a97e839cb66ce36ba8ecba19e736e54925b82ec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/a97e839cb66ce36ba8ecba19e736e54925b82ec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/5428bb235227ffa78ddb78edb36fea2eb21b01d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/5428bb235227ffa78ddb78edb36fea2eb21b01d7","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDU0MjhiYjIzNTIyN2ZmYTc4ZGRiNzhlZGIzNmZlYTJlYjIxYjAxZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4e38a5329451efb4087b61a90ca9939d783cdfb4","sha":"4e38a5329451efb4087b61a90ca9939d783cdfb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4e38a5329451efb4087b61a90ca9939d783cdfb4"}],"sha":"5428bb235227ffa78ddb78edb36fea2eb21b01d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/5428bb235227ffa78ddb78edb36fea2eb21b01d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4e38a5329451efb4087b61a90ca9939d783cdfb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-08T15:19:09Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-08T15:19:09Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"feat: Add mock validation failure mode for RCA testing\n\nAdded infrastructure to test RCA retry logic without Cloud Run validation:\n- ValidatorAgent: Added mock_failure parameter to inject fake validation failures\n- Pipeline: Added mock_validation_failure parameter to create_lab_pipeline()\n- CLI: Added --mock-validation-failure flag to main_adk.py\n- RCA Agent: Improved instructions to explicitly read from session state\n\nMock failure mode:\n- Simulates IP addressing mismatch error on R1 interface\n- Returns realistic validation_result structure\n- Enables fast RCA testing (~30s vs ~90s per iteration)\n\nNote: RCA agent currently cannot read validation_result from session state\nbecause Validator (BaseAgent) doesn''t output to conversation context.\nNext step: Make Validator yield validation summary for RCA to read.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e196879c295b9541c641e6b35abae16e7c24978b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/e196879c295b9541c641e6b35abae16e7c24978b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/4e38a5329451efb4087b61a90ca9939d783cdfb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/