thub.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4f45abede39d5fd4fe7eb62c9eced53bb67521a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T05:09:44Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T05:09:44Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Update designer topology schema to devices/connections format\n\nChanged the designer agent to generate topology YAML using the correct\nschema format expected by headless-runner:\n\nChanges:\n- Replaced Containerlab format with devices/connections schema\n- devices: array with type, name, hardware, device_id, config fields\n- connections: array defining interface links between devices\n- Device names now uppercase (R1, R2, etc.) for consistency\n- Added UUID generation instructions for device_id\n- Updated example topology format in prompt\n- Added Serial0/0/0, Serial0/0/1 to platform reference\n\nThe new format matches the working example from headless-runner docs.\nHowever, headless-runner still exits with code 2 - further debugging\nneeded in headless-runner container code.\n\nRelated files:\n- adk_agents/designer.py: Updated prompt and topology format\n\nTesting:\n- Designer now consistently generates correct topology schema\n- Topology validated: devices/connections format present in spec.json\n- Cloud Run Job still failing - issue appears to be in headless-runner","tree":{"sha":"953c2f5fa2a01c0f849d38cf648f9751f24c2300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/953c2f5fa2a01c0f849d38cf648f9751f24c2300"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/4f45abede39d5fd4fe7eb62c9eced53bb67521a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4f45abede39d5fd4fe7eb62c9eced53bb67521a7","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDRmNDVhYmVkZTM5ZDVmZDRmZTdlYjYyYzllY2VkNTNiYjY3NTIxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544","sha":"4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544"}],"sha":"4f45abede39d5fd4fe7eb62c9eced53bb67521a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4f45abede39d5fd4fe7eb62c9eced53bb67521a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T03:36:42Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T03:36:42Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Improve designer agent prompt for better LLM reliability\n\nThe designer agent was experiencing inconsistent output behavior where\nsometimes it would call linting tools and produce output, other times\nit would not. This was due to the LLM (Gemini 2.5 Flash) not\nconsistently following the instructions.\n\nChanges:\n- Restructured prompt to use explicit numbered STEP-by-STEP workflow\n- Emphasized MANDATORY tool calls with stronger language (CRITICAL, MUST)\n- Provided concrete example of lint_cli() format with parameters\n- Simplified output instructions by removing redundant explanations\n- Made the workflow more linear and easier to follow\n\nResults:\n- Designer now consistently calls lint_topology() in Step 3\n- Designer now consistently calls lint_cli() for each device in Steps 5 and 7\n- Designer now reliably writes to session state\n- Full pipeline works end-to-end: Planner → Designer → Author → Validator → Cloud Run\n\nThe improved prompt structure helps guide the LLM through the required\nworkflow more reliably, reducing output variability.","tree":{"sha":"ef9518a514060ea5e1742f533279e041f94cecc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/ef9518a514060ea5e1742f533279e041f94cecc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDRhZDc3NGU2NDEwYTZlMjk0ZTk3OGMyY2Y3NWMxMjhmMGEzOTk1NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab","sha":"e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab"}],"sha":"4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/4ad774e6410a6e294e978c2cf75c128f0a399544"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T03:16:12Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T03:16:12Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Add session state flush points to ensure output_key persistence\n\n- Remove broken session state extraction logic\n- Simplify SessionStateWriterAgent to just verify session state\n- These agents serve as ''flush points'' between pipeline stages\n- Add fallback to read from output files in validator\n- Confirmed: ADK''s output_key works but only persists between agents when flush points exist\n\nFixes validator accessing design_output and draft_lab_guide from session state.","tree":{"sha":"32d770b755bb5199e0b99268d7eda507072d4872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/32d770b755bb5199e0b99268d7eda507072d4872"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKGU1ZjQyZmY4YmNlZWIxMTQxMmY1MzNmZTA3ZWQwZTJmN2UyMWVmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67","sha":"2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67"}],"sha":"e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/e5f42ff8bceeb11412f533fe07ed0e2f7e21efab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T02:09:06Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T02:09:06Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Add session state writer and improve validator error handling\n\nThis commit fixes the ADK session state issue where design_output wasn''t\navailable when the validator runs:\n\n1. Added SessionStateWriterAgent - extracts JSON from previous agent output\n   and writes to session state (though ADK''s output_key already works)\n\n2. Updated pipeline to include state writers after designer and author agents\n\n3. Improved validator JSON parsing with better error handling:\n   - Check for empty/whitespace-only strings before parsing\n   - Handle both string and dict types\n   - Gracefully skip validation on JSON parse errors instead of crashing\n   - Add detailed logging for debugging\n\n4. Discovered that ADK''s output_key IS working correctly - the session state\n   writers are mostly redundant but provide a backup mechanism\n\nThe validator now handles all edge cases gracefully and won''t crash the pipeline.","tree":{"sha":"6a4dcfc5b2912b7c8690232ae78c9499fbc7e0db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/6a4dcfc5b2912b7c8690232ae78c9499fbc7e0db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67","node_id":"C_kwDOQPRvt9oAKDJkZWZkMWIxYWRmMTE5M2Y5YTVjMzBkNWVkOTkyOWZkODg1ZDFlNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae","sha":"e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae"}],"sha":"2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/2defd1b1adf1193f9a5c30d5ed9929fd885d1e67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commits/e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T02:01:13Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T02:01:13Z","email":"racampos@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Campos"},"message":"fix: Complete Cloud Run Jobs validator integration\n\nThis commit fixes all Cloud Run Jobs integration issues for headless validation:\n\n1. Fixed spec payload to include required Pydantic fields (artifact_prefix, run_id, lab_id)\n2. Updated GCS upload to use fixed location (pending/latest/spec.json) that job expects\n3. Simplified job submission by removing --update-env-vars (now in job definition)\n4. Added graceful skip if design_output missing from session state\n\nCloud Run Job configuration changes (done via gcloud, not in code):\n- Removed args with shell expansion syntax\n- Set SPEC_GCS_PATH environment variable permanently\n\nThe Cloud Run Jobs integration is now fully working. Remaining issue is ADK\nsession state: design_output not available when validator runs. Validator now\nskips gracefully instead of crashing the pipeline.\n\nSee VALIDATOR_FIXES_SUMMARY.md for complete details.","tree":{"sha":"f3bf3a2450c5a991a9c37784efe38de2c0b63e44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/trees/f3bf3a2450c5a991a9c37784efe38de2c0b63e44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/git/commits/e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4667189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/racampos","id":4667189,"login":"racampos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcxODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/racampos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/racampos/cloud-run-hackathon/commit/e4cafd18bfb25795ca3d4434929d29e922452dae"