s_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/a26773cbf4cab7d64b302aa1744ea38309e38523/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T22:01:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T22:01:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Implement bilingual materials system (English/Polish)\n\nSystem Changes:\n- Modified generate-materials-data.py to generate bilingual structure\n- Updated app.js to load language-specific materials based on currentLanguage\n- Enhanced i18n.js to reload materials when language changes\n- materials-data.js now contains both EN and PL versions (1.14 MB total)\n\nPolish Translation:\n- Created all 24 .pl.md files for Polish versions\n- Fully translated: behavioral/mid-level.pl.md (16KB - complete Polish translation)\n- Other .pl.md files: Currently English copies as fallback (will be translated progressively)\n\nCache Versions Updated:\n- i18n.js: v8 → v9\n- materials-data.js: v8 → v9 (now bilingual)\n- app.js: v8 → v9 (language-aware material loading)\n\nHow It Works:\n- When language = ''pl'', system loads .pl.md versions\n- When language = ''en'', system loads English versions\n- Falls back to English if Polish version not yet translated\n- Automatic material reload when user switches language\n\nFiles: 48 materials total (24 EN + 24 PL)\nNext Steps: Progressive translation of remaining .pl.md files","tree":{"sha":"fc9ae1eef7db3b19591f48ed3f44e31df829aec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/fc9ae1eef7db3b19591f48ed3f44e31df829aec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/a26773cbf4cab7d64b302aa1744ea38309e38523","verification":{"payload":"tree fc9ae1eef7db3b19591f48ed3f44e31df829aec2\nparent 0d6de5c1d9347bd19b1589b8e215b0c579ff4ef4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762552885 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762552885 +0000\n\nImplement bilingual materials system (English/Polish)\n\nSystem Changes:\n- Modified generate-materials-data.py to generate bilingual structure\n- Updated app.js to load language-specific materials based on currentLanguage\n- Enhanced i18n.js to reload materials when language changes\n- materials-data.js now contains both EN and PL versions (1.14 MB total)\n\nPolish Translation:\n- Created all 24 .pl.md files for Polish versions\n- Fully translated: behavioral/mid-level.pl.md (16KB - complete Polish translation)\n- Other .pl.md files: Currently English copies as fallback (will be translated progressively)\n\nCache Versions Updated:\n- i18n.js: v8 → v9\n- materials-data.js: v8 → v9 (now bilingual)\n- app.js: v8 → v9 (language-aware material loading)\n\nHow It Works:\n- When language = ''pl'', system loads .pl.md versions\n- When language = ''en'', system loads English versions\n- Falls back to English if Polish version not yet translated\n- Automatic material reload when user switches language\n\nFiles: 48 materials total (24 EN + 24 PL)\nNext Steps: Progressive translation of remaining .pl.md files\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ2IpPt9\nUYg1+Se5MlNP2ONzYJ2QTzqcC0h+VhWuJbrgnJKpiA3TxMBL9QaiBrS64t+SUFjgILxrIkgT5LQG\nIQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-07T22:01:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users