"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/4ce802789219c787861316764933c314407156ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T08:24:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T08:24:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix start quiz button with defensive null checks\n\nAdded null checks before adding event listeners to prevent errors if buttons are missing.\nThis ensures the quiz functionality works reliably even if there are DOM loading issues.\n\nChanges:\n- Added defensive null checks for all quiz buttons in initializeQuizSection()\n- Added debug logging to help diagnose initialization issues\n- Bumped app.js cache version from v=8 to v=9 to force browser cache refresh\n\nThis fixes the issue where clicking \"Start quiz\" button didn''t work.","tree":{"sha":"9007050d739dd4c8192d20826904a48cad5270ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/9007050d739dd4c8192d20826904a48cad5270ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/4ce802789219c787861316764933c314407156ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 9007050d739dd4c8192d20826904a48cad5270ca\nparent 516674b35639c4110ae89dc5183c42f9e53703ca\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762503894 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762503894 +0000\n\nFix start quiz button with defensive null checks\n\nAdded null checks before adding event listeners to prevent errors if buttons are missing.\nThis ensures the quiz functionality works reliably even if there are DOM loading issues.\n\nChanges:\n- Added defensive null checks for all quiz buttons in initializeQuizSection()\n- Added debug logging to help diagnose initialization issues\n- Bumped app.js cache version from v=8 to v=9 to force browser cache refresh\n\nThis fixes the issue where clicking \"