to-detect language for quiz questions\n- Added 3 new categories to web interface\n- Bilingual support for all new content\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Restored lost quiz questions from commit 91696ec\n- Updated cache versions for proper browser refresh (v=8 and v=9)\n- Fixed misleading statistics (24 files, 150+ questions, 10 categories)\n\nConflict Resolution:\n- quiz-data.js: Used incoming version with full 154 questions and improved randomization","tree":{"sha":"c642f57f91d9f200a5123f4390f07f1b96ff6491","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/c642f57f91d9f200a5123f4390f07f1b96ff6491"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/a064971c93e5088b50453a77004ab4f2254116e7","verification":{"payload":"tree c642f57f91d9f200a5123f4390f07f1b96ff6491\nparent 74acef0eceff51cf07c97f5c99b7b96c11d08e33\nparent 4c3f6da88664e90c7d395820cc02e3d2ed4e4248\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762499005 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762499005 +0000\n\nMerge comprehensive interview preparation enhancements\n\nMerging all improvements from claude/add-knowledge-sections branch:\n\nContent Additions:\n- 154 quiz questions (77 EN + 77 PL) with improved Fisher-Yates randomization\n- 3 new knowledge guides (Interview Categories, Problem-Solving Framework, Resume Tips)\n- Enhanced behavioral questions with STAR Method framework\n- String algorithms and bitwise operations sections\n- Angular, SOLID, React, jQuery, T-SQL, OOP fundamentals\n- 2,500+ lines of interview preparation content\n\nTechnical Improvements:\n- Materials database: 24 files, 583 KB\n- Fixed quiz randomization algorithm with Fisher-Yates shuffle\n- Auto-detect language for quiz questions\n- Added 3 new categories to web interface\n- Bilingual support for all new content\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Restored lost quiz questions from commit 91696ec\n- Updated cache versions for proper browser refresh (v=8 and v=9)\n- Fixed misleading statistics (24 files, 150+ questions, 10 categories)\n\nConflict Resolution:\n- quiz-data.js: Used incoming version with full 154 questions and improved randomization\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH9PdfyR\n2leuICdKpUO1R3AJMwH2xp3dFWFoW1t2+M915w/MW6X0i7mqdQHgH96RquN1CMgKlRLLgPZilbtH\n2wM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-07T07:07:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gap032/interview-master/commit/a064971c93e5088b50453a77004ab4f2254116e7","node_id":"C_kwDOQPU4_doAKGEwNjQ5NzFjOTNlNTA4OGI1MDQ1M2E3NzAwNGFiNGYyMjU0MTE2ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gap032/interview-master/commit/74acef0eceff51cf07c97f5c99b7b96c11d08e33","sha":"74acef0eceff51cf07c97f5c99b7b96c11d08e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/74acef0eceff51cf07c97f5c99b7b96c11d08e33"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/gap032/interview-master/commit/4c3f6da88664e90c7d395820cc02e3d2ed4e4248","sh