7 per language)\n   - Bilingual structure: quizQuestionsData.en and quizQuestionsData.pl\n   - Categories: algorithms, system-design, programming, architecture,\n     databases, devops, behavioral\n   - Levels: mid, senior, principal\n\n2. Improved randomization with Fisher-Yates algorithm\n   - Added shuffleArray() function for true uniform distribution\n   - Updated getFilteredQuestions() to use Fisher-Yates shuffle\n   - Auto-detects language from i18n (currentLanguage variable)\n\n3. Updated statistics\n   - Changed question count from \"42\" to \"150+\"\n   - Updated cache version: quiz-data.js v=9 (was v=8)\n\nResult: Users now have access to full question bank with proper randomization\nacross both English and Polish languages. Quiz will automatically use the\nlanguage selected in the app.","tree":{"sha":"2f9f4e2b3137b122b1f855ad7b74b0f44c4e2b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/2f9f4e2b3137b122b1f855ad7b74b0f44c4e2b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/4c3f6da88664e90c7d395820cc02e3d2ed4e4248","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f9f4e2b3137b122b1f855ad7b74b0f44c4e2b72\nparent 4381646e47ca94525b4d88f74a9bfc353c802123\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762478921 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762478921 +0000\n\nRestore lost quiz questions - recover 154 questions from commit 91696ec\n\nProblem: Quiz database was accidentally reduced from 154 to 42 questions\n- Lost during merge/branch operations\n- Commit 91696ec had full bilingual database (77 EN + 77 PL questions)\n- Current HEAD only had 42 Polish questions\n\nSolution: Restored full quiz database from commit 91696ec\n\nChanges:\n1. Restored quiz-data.js with 154 questions (77 per language)\n   - Bilingual structure: quizQuestionsData.en and quizQuestionsData.pl\n   - Categories: algorithms, system-design, programming, architecture,\n     databases, devops, behavioral\n   - Levels: mid, senior, principal\n\n2. Improved randomization with Fisher-Yates algorithm\n   - Added shuffleArray() function for true uniform distribution\n   - Updated getFilteredQuestions() to use Fisher-Yates shuffle\n   - Auto-detects language from i18n (currentLanguage variable)\n\n3. Updated statistics\n   - Changed question count from \"42\" to \"150+\"\n   - Updated cache version: quiz-data.js v=9 (was v=8)\n\nResult: Users now have access to full question bank with proper randomization\nacross both English and Polish languages. Quiz will automatically use the\nlanguage selected in the app.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOAs/y98\nHU0013nGgL1vg/sLZ1fNREDJPUqfNEAsaT0bmikjy/ArAJlYasPmZ10h4NSCKEcJbfG6yu6SKLp7\nmAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-07T01:28:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gap032/interview-master/commit/4c3f6da88664e90c7d395820cc02e3d2ed4e4248","node_id":"C_kwDOQPU4_doAKDRjM2