,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/75fd2032da7ab9a08e656529709b20370a9d0707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-07T01:02:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-07T01:02:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add comprehensive interview preparation resources from GitHub repository analysis\n\nThis commit adds content derived from analyzing 5 prominent GitHub repositories:\n- awesome-behavioral-interviews\n- master-coding-interview\n- tech-interview-handbook\n- ztm-master-the-coding-interview-ds-algo\n- coding-interview-university\n\nChanges include:\n\n1. Behavioral Questions Enhancement (behavioral/mid-level.md):\n   - Added STAR Method framework with comprehensive explanation\n   - Interview Preparation Grid template\n   - 15+ general interview tips\n   - 7 behavioral categories: Leadership, Conflict, Failure, Pressure,\n     Problem-Solving, Feedback, Continuous Development\n   - Expanded from 44 to 493 lines (~449 lines added)\n\n2. String Algorithms (data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md):\n   - Section 7: String Algorithms (690+ lines)\n   - Palindrome checking (two-pointer technique)\n   - Anagram detection (hash map and sorting approaches)\n   - Substring search (naive and KMP algorithm)\n   - Longest common prefix\n   - String reversal techniques\n   - Examples in Python, C#, and JavaScript\n\n3. Bitwise Operations (data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md):\n   - Section 8: Bitwise Operations (630+ lines)\n   - Basic operators (AND, OR, XOR, NOT, shifts)\n   - Common problems (count set bits, power of 2, single number, reverse bits)\n   - Bitwise tricks and patterns\n   - Real-world applications and optimizations\n\n4. Problem-Solving Framework (new file):\n   - problem-solving-framework.md\n   - UMPIRE Method: Understand, Match, Plan, Implement, Review, Evaluate\n   - Pattern recognition for 20+ algorithm patterns\n   - Interview communication strategies\n   - Time/space complexity analysis\n   - Complete sample problem walkthrough\n   - Practice checklist and resources\n\n5. Resume and Interview Tips (new file):\n   - resume-and-interview-tips.md\n   - Resume writing best practices and common mistakes\n   - Detailed resume sections with examples\n   - 3 complete resume templates (Entry/Mid/Senior level)\n   - 3-month interview preparation timeline\n   - Technical and behavioral interview strategies\n   - Salary negotiation tactics with email templates\n   - Post-interview follow-up and offer evaluation\n\n6. Updated README.md:\n   - Added sections 9 and 10 for new guides\n   - Updated Recent Updates with detailed changelog\n   - Materials database size: 509 KB (was 461 KB)\n\n7. Regenerated materials-data.js:\n   - Includes all new content for web application\n   - Size increased from 461 KB to 509 KB\n\nTotal additions: ~2,500+ lines of new interview preparation content\n\nAddresses: Integration of valuable content from leading interview prep repositories","tree":{"sha":"c2137d121db83f50d20d774a535a2a62f9af965a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/c2137d121db83f50d20d774a535a2a62f9af965a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/75fd2032da7ab9a08e656529709b20370a9d0707","verification":{"payload":"tree c2137d121db83f50d20d774a535a2a62f9af965a\nparent 24e972a308901a8a842e75ac9ff7449408cbe61d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762477359 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762477359 +0000\n\nAdd comprehensive interview preparation resources from GitHub repository analysis\n\nThis commit adds content derived from analyzing 5 prominent GitHub repositories:\n- awesome-behavioral-interviews\n- master-coding-interview\n- tech-interview-handbook\n- ztm-master-the-coding-interview-ds-algo\n- coding-interview-university\n\nChanges include:\n\n1. Behavioral Questions Enhancement (behavioral/mid-level.md):\n   - Added STAR Method framework with comprehensive explanation\n   - Interview Preparation Grid template\n   - 15+ general interview tips\n   - 7 behavioral categories: Leadership, Conflict, Failure, Pressure,\n     Problem-Solving, Feedback, Continuous Development\n   - Expanded from 44 to 493 lines (~449 lines added)\n\n2. String Algorithms (data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md):\n   - Section 7: String Algorithms (690+ lines)\n   - Palindrome checking (two-pointer technique)\n   - Anagram detection (hash map and sorting approaches)\n   - Substring search (naive and KMP algorithm)\n   - Longest common prefix\n   - String reversal techniques\n   - Examples in Python, C#, and JavaScript\n\n3. Bitwise Operations (data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md):\n   - Section 8: Bitwise Operations (630+ lines)\n   - Basic operators (AND, OR, XOR, NOT, shifts)\n   - Common problems (count set bits, power of 2, single number, reverse bits)\n   - Bitwise tricks and patterns\n   - Real-world applications and optimizations\n\n4. Problem-Solving Framework (new file):\n   - problem-solving-framework.md\n   - UMPIRE Method: Understand, Match, Plan, Implement, Review, Evaluate\n   - Pattern recognition for 20+ algorithm patterns\n   - Interview communication strategies\n   - Time/space complexity analysis\n   - Complete sample problem walkthrough\n   - Practice checklist and resources\n\n5. Resume and Interview Tips (new file):\n   - resume-and-interview-tips.md\n   - Resume writing best practices and common mistakes\n   - Detailed resume sections with examples\n   - 3 complete resume templates (Entry/Mid/Senior level)\n   - 3-month interview preparation timeline\n   - Technical and behavioral interview strategies\n   - Salary negotiation tactics with email templates\n   - Post-interview follow-up and offer evaluation\n\n6. Updated README.md:\n   - Added sections 9 and 10 for new guides\n   - Updated Recent Updates with detailed changelog\n   - Materials database size: 509 KB (was 461 KB)\n\n7. Regenerated materials-data.js:\n   - Includes all new content for web application\n   - Size increased from 461 KB to 509 KB\n\nTotal additions: ~2,500+ lines of new interview preparation content\n\nAddresses: Integration of valuable content from leading interview prep repositories\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBeTYOw3\n/lCnK8TSRZOJN3AQXDcSpguHiWmi5GBx/gXO9Og3EP4r1A59Im5eJ4JvMsWu62FVvwv7fCf+um1d\n0wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-07T01:02:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscrip