5-11-07T00:35:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add 17 advanced technical questions in both English and Polish\n\nAdded comprehensive questions covering:\n- Advanced Data Structures: Segment Tree, Fenwick Tree, streaming median with heaps, thread-safe LRU cache\n- String Operations: rotation detection, adjacent duplicates removal, Rabin-Karp pattern matching, longest palindrome\n- Performance Optimization: lazy vs eager loading (EF Core), connection pooling, query caching strategies, StringBuilder performance\n- Security: SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, authentication vs authorization, CSRF protection, secure password storage\n\nTotal question count: 314 (157 per language)","tree":{"sha":"ea7724ed6171973fd00007bda43a764251c33a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/ea7724ed6171973fd00007bda43a764251c33a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/96f57455710bdad9347d909f4a8c1496263a4884","verification":{"payload":"tree ea7724ed6171973fd00007bda43a764251c33a05\nparent bf8d7e78c2d084c51befbd110f23bb7679895328\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762475748 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762475748 +0000\n\nAdd 17 advanced technical questions in both English and Polish\n\nAdded comprehensive questions covering:\n- Advanced Data Structures: Segment Tree, Fenwick Tree, streaming median with heaps, thread-safe LRU cache\n- String Operations: rotation detection, adjacent duplicates removal, Rabin-Karp pattern matching, longest palindrome\n- Performance Optimization: lazy vs eager loading (EF Core), connection pooling, query caching strategies, StringBuilder performance\n- Security: SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, authentication vs authorization, CSRF protection, secure password storage\n\nTotal question count: 314 (157 per language)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg