032/interview-master/commits/91696eca1592492a26d7a505553e38b5db07947f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T23:50:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T23:50:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Expand and translate quiz database to 103+ questions per language\n\nMajor improvements:\n- Expanded quiz database from ~70 to 103 questions per language\n- Added full English translations for all quiz questions\n- Implemented language-aware quiz system that automatically selects questions based on user''s language preference\n- Added new questions across all categories:\n  * Algorithms (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * System Design (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Programming Languages (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Architecture (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Databases (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * DevOps (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Behavioral (Mid, Senior & Principal levels)\n\nTechnical changes:\n- Restructured quiz-data.js with separate EN/PL question arrays\n- Updated getFilteredQuestions() to accept language parameter\n- Modified app.js to pass currentLanguage to quiz functions\n- Added missing i18n translations for quiz UI elements\n- Category names now use translations from i18n system\n\nTotal: 206 questions (103 EN + 103 PL)","tree":{"sha":"6aa26424f28188a8fa201eac27310ffcc8724a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/6aa26424f28188a8fa201eac27310ffcc8724a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/91696eca1592492a26d7a505553e38b5db07947f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6aa26424f28188a8fa201eac27310ffcc8724a74\nparent 0bc27239e654d3deb69e090abd1934c333067bec\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762473042 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762473042 +0000\n\nExpand and translate quiz database to 103+ questions per language\n\nMajor improvements:\n- Expanded quiz database from ~70 to 103 questions per language\n- Added full English translations for all quiz questions\n- Implemented language-aware quiz system that automatically selects questions based on user''s language preference\n- Added new questions across all categories:\n  * Algorithms (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * System Design (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Programming Languages (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Architecture (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Databases (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * DevOps (Mid & Senior levels)\n  * Behavioral (Mid, Senior & Principal levels)\n\nTechnical changes:\n- Restructured quiz-data.js with separate EN/PL question arrays\n- Updated getFilteredQuestions() to accept language parameter\n- Modified app.js to pass currentLanguage to quiz functions\n- Added missing i18n translations for quiz UI elements\n- Category names now use translations from i18n system\n\nTotal: 206 questions (103 EN + 103 PL)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLow8NkV\nWRqBn/tgybLfsqLLhOI4nvP7QqZPjBH/PZFADeEPglEEygPDKPqfHpl5pVK+/MkFMGV/eO/h933U\nXAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-06T23:50:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/st