ready existed in i18n.js:\n  * EN: ''No quizzes completed yet''\n  * PL: ''Nie ukończono jeszcze żadnych quizów''\n- Updated cache-busting to v=5\n\nNow Statistics section is fully bilingual!","tree":{"sha":"68be9bb84fa53a41f1525796c242ed2270207931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/68be9bb84fa53a41f1525796c242ed2270207931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/03a2e9baf43a167e33688fca3f81e8c4e23f3e69","verification":{"payload":"tree 68be9bb84fa53a41f1525796c242ed2270207931\nparent 3988149e50e4e7f253a06f4c1df4b4489ac70124\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762470272 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762470272 +0000\n\nFix hardcoded Polish text in Statistics section\n\nPROBLEM:\nWhen language is set to English, Statistics section still showed\nPolish text ''Nie ukończono jeszcze żadnych quizów'' instead of\nEnglish translation.\n\nROOT CAUSE:\nHardcoded Polish text in app.js line 476 instead of using\ntranslation function t().\n\nSOLUTION:\n- Changed hardcoded text to use t(''statsNoData'')\n- Translation already existed in i18n.js:\n  * EN: ''No quizzes completed yet''\n  * PL: ''Nie ukończono jeszcze żadnych quizów''\n- Updated cache-busting to v=5\n\nNow Statistics section is fully bilingual!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEPTcFdz\nanUS7UTELYCao7I0vkRKj3jtk5r+3RnuEVbY8qVNJLiDZ32EMk19UYyE4dDDg0FGsNvar0a7N5iC\n3ww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-06T23:05:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/