:"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/66e218995a89676d3ae51623eec1ffcae3a25879/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T23:02:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T23:02:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Complete C# examples for data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md\n\nAdded comprehensive C# implementations for ALL 6 sections:\n1. Array vs Linked List - custom and built-in implementations\n2. Hash Table - collision resolution with chaining, generics\n3. Binary Search Tree - insert, search, delete with generics\n4. Cycle Detection - Floyd''s algorithm, multiple approaches\n5. Stack with Min - two-stack and tuple-based solutions\n6. First Non-Repeating Character - 4 different approaches\n\nTotal additions: +454 lines\nFile size: 891 → 1490 lines\n\nEach section includes:\n- Multiple C# implementation approaches\n- Generic implementations where appropriate\n- Built-in .NET collection alternatives\n- Complete working examples with Main()\n- Performance comparisons\n\nAll mid-level DSA topics now have Python AND C# examples!","tree":{"sha":"c394eb635f0bda6a453d573d6f296da68156357b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/c394eb635f0bda6a453d573d6f296da68156357b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/66e218995a89676d3ae51623eec1ffcae3a25879","verification":{"payload":"tree c394eb635f0bda6a453d573d6f296da68156357b\nparent 9559ceb5f7e1cd7cad009aa35450e336b147f83f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762470167 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762470167 +0000\n\nComplete C# examples for data-structures-algorithms/mid-level.md\n\nAdded comprehensive C# implementations for ALL 6 sections:\n1. Array vs Linked List - custom and built-in implementations\n2. Hash Table - collision resolution with chaining, generics\n3. Binary Search Tree - insert, search, delete with generics\n4. Cycle Detection - Floyd''s algorithm, multiple approaches\n5. Stack with Min - two-stack and tuple-based solutions\n6. First Non-Repeating Character - 4 different approaches\n\nTotal additions: +454 lines\nFile size: 891 → 1490 lines\n\nEach section includes:\n- Multiple C# implementation approaches\n- Generic implementations where appropriate\n- Built-in .NET collection alternatives\n- Complete working examples with Main()\n- Performance comparisons\n\nAll mid-level DSA topics now have Python AND C# examples!\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMBA7+HP\nHmL71Qe4LMpNI3n33xEqC/Mpx5Lveh3MEqe6BucUkCx20hVNGnZyj1DcNeEYmJifwojV2yLP7P4m\nzQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-06T23:02:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g