tml_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/commits/f09556c1a642ba47729ed6d90f49dc939113cf2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T21:13:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T21:13:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Complete bilingual translation for Quiz and Statistics sections\n\n- Add data-i18n attributes to all Quiz section elements:\n  * Quiz title, subtitle, and form labels\n  * Category, level, and question count selectors\n  * All quiz option values (categories and levels)\n  * Quiz control buttons (Start, Quit, Next Question)\n  * Results action buttons (Retry, New Quiz)\n\n- Add data-i18n attributes to all Statistics section elements:\n  * Statistics title and all stat card labels\n  * Category breakdown heading\n  * Reset statistics button\n\n- Enhance i18n.js updateUI() function:\n  * Add specific handling for OPTION elements\n  * Improve icon preservation logic to support icons before, after, or on both sides of text\n  * Properly handle buttons with FontAwesome icons in any position\n\nAll UI elements now fully support English/Polish language switching.","tree":{"sha":"0b56634511e18a5a6d0190365efacad4185bd3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/0b56634511e18a5a6d0190365efacad4185bd3a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/f