 & Cloud, Behavioral)\n- 3 experience levels per domain (Mid-level, Senior-level, Principal-level)\n\nEach section includes:\n- Detailed questions with real-world context\n- Comprehensive answers with code examples\n- Complexity analysis and trade-offs\n- Best practices and key takeaways\n\nTotal: 21 markdown files with extensive examples covering topics from basic algorithms to distributed systems architecture.","tree":{"sha":"48847d859b2bcd975affe05a61258510843e343e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/trees/48847d859b2bcd975affe05a61258510843e343e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gap032/interview-master/git/commits/d108581eddfb78dfc5f6647d1ecfd643d5b6a5fd","verification":{"payload":"tree 48847d859b2bcd975affe05a61258510843e343e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762459445 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1762459445 +0000\n\nAdd comprehensive technical interview questions repository\n\nCreated a structured repository of interview questions for computer engineering, programming, and IT architect positions.\n\nContent organized by:\n- 7 technical domains (Data Structures & Algorithms, System Design, Programming Languages, Architecture, Databases, DevOps & Cloud, Behavioral)\n- 3 experience levels per domain (Mid-level, Senior-level, Principal-level)\n\nEach section includes:\n- Detailed questions with real-world context\n- Comprehensive answers with code examples\n- Complexity analysis and trade-offs\n- Best practices and key takeaways\n\nTotal: 21 markdown files with extensive examples covering topics from basic algorithms to distributed systems architecture.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEp/gyuo\navp48OaPSJfbp0K26wAajbnkNC+jjwFq2RFCuIROYmCq++Ju82RIgY7hTbg+Zqac5AK48IMIkmlq\nzwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_a