's <head>, and the shared @layer names collided across\nbuilds, silently breaking the shell''s own responsive utility classes\n(the sidebar and its toggle buttons disappeared). Remote content is\nnow self-contained via ViewEncapsulation.ShadowDom in planning-mfe and\nfinancial-mfe, so the loader is no longer needed and has been removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ad0ae6aa0d0c52dcfbd920cb5bd9820107c5154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurakmaljalil91/cerxos-shell/git/trees/7ad0ae6aa0d0c52dcfbd920cb5bd9820107c5154"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurakmaljalil91/cerxos-shell/git/commits/8d6bb703f99e79f0087d5b750328b8f11b38e981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48422687?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nurakmaljalil91","id":48422687,"login":"nurakmaljalil91","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDIyNjg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nurakmaljalil91","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nurakmaljalil91/cerxos-shell/commit/8d6bb703f99e79f0087d5b750328b8f11b38e981","node_id":"C_kwDOQQFZcdoAKDhkNmJiNzAzZjk5ZTc5ZjAwODdkNWI3NTAzM