nkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/9736509896e9edefd905ac1c1fc2019ba288ec85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:24:10Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:24:10Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"message":"feat(epic-sty): tokenise the pages, converge the palette, freeze the layout\n\nSTY-03..STY-07 of EPIC-STY, executed and verified by `make sty-gate`.\n\n- tokens.css: the single palette home, extracted from semantic-tokens.css,\n  which becomes the component layer and @imports it\n- badge state pairs (bg/text/border) per theme; --color-on-primary and\n  --color-scrim added; high-contrast --color-primary-hover fixed from\n  #ffffff (white-on-white button) to #ffff00 with black text\n- app.html, index.html, responsive-lab.html, pkc-docs-index.html: zero colour\n  literals left in inline styles; state hues resolve to tokens\n- responsive-lab pins data-theme=\"dark\" — its designed theme; the light media\n  query had been rendering a dark workbench on a light canvas\n- pkc-docs-index joins the token layer via @import inside its own <style>, so\n  no DOM node is added and the layout freeze stays clean\n- style-audit.spec.js: walks @import chains for the token census, composites\n  alpha, branches on gradients, and classifies clip-text and emoji findings\n- new: layout-freeze.spec.js (geometry across 6 pages x 5 viewports, with\n  padding/display/colour-only mutation controls), theme-swap.spec.js\n  (palette-swap proof plus a gate that rejects a breaking palette)\n\nMeasured after the change: 0 confirmed contrast failures on all six pages,\n0 used-but-undeclared tokens, 30/30 freeze checks clean, 18/18 theme cells\nwith 0 confirmed failures on reachable cells.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"abce26dcc4d52048d94b44f05830bd710beb8b10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/trees/abce26dcc4d52048d94b44f05830bd710beb8b10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/commits/9736509896e9edefd905ac1c1fc2019ba288ec85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/9736509896e9edefd905ac1c1fc2019ba288ec85","node_id":"C_kwDOQQQJA9oAKDk3MzY1MDk4OTZlOWVkZWZkOTA1YWMxYzFmYzIwMTliYTI4OGVjODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c","sha":"1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c"}],"sha":"9736509896e9edefd905ac1c1fc2019ba288ec85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/9736509896e9edefd905ac1c1fc2019ba288ec85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:02:27Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:02:27Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"message":"feat(epic-sty): the computed-style audit harness (STY-01)\n\nPromotes the audit from a throwaway inspection to the program''s measurement pass.\nIt loads every loadable surface in a real browser and reads *computed* styles, so\nthe baseline cannot be guessed from the stylesheets.\n\nMeasures per page: distinct text/background/border colours, inline-style count,\ncontrast failures, tokens declared, tokens declared-but-unused, tokens\nused-but-undeclared. Contrast resolves the effective background through transparent\nancestors and composites alpha, cross-checked against the known 21:1 for black on\nwhite.\n\nThe raw output is gitignored; the committed baseline lives at\ndocs/sprints/_active/style/baseline.json.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"67aa8d1d9d0ff79b18afa3165525616bcab6d5bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/trees/67aa8d1d9d0ff79b18afa3165525616bcab6d5bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/commits/1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/1bcc7bac0bc9792eb882e4a82ed4281594be6e4c","node_id":"C_kwDOQQQJA9oAKDFiY2M3YmFjMGJjOTc5MmViODgyZTRhODJlZDQyODE1OTRiZTZlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/9d6690fc832e800024496ec5