ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:01:35Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"message":"feat(cdo-10): declare the islands[] inventory in the registry\n\n25 loadable surfaces — 4 top-level pages, 17 components, 4 module pages — each\ndeclaring url, kind, hydration, isolation, budget, metrics endpoint and island\nMCard. Verified by the INV-CDO-28 totality gate, which fails on an undeclared\nsurface, a duplicate declaration, a declared island with no surface behind it,\nand a missing hydration directive.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d7f979c57554104aa5189d57469564cd0f647b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/trees/8d7f979c57554104aa5189d57469564cd0f647b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/commits/d419f08935e1aa382329d999337cf666d8e74434","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/d419f08935e1aa382329d999337cf666d8e74434","node_id":"C_kwDOQQQJA9oAKGQ0MTlmMDg5MzVlMWFhMzgyMzI5ZDk5OTMzN2NmNjY2ZDhlNzQ0MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0","sha":"617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0"}],"sha":"d419f08935e1aa382329d999337cf666d8e74434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/d419f08935e1aa382329d999337cf666d8e74434"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:57:28Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:57:28Z","email":"koo0905@gmail.com","name":"Ben Koo"},"message":"refactor: remove mcard-js entirely; reimplement on the published clm-kernel\n\nINV-CDO-33 requires MCard and CLM functionality to come solely from the\npublished clm-kernel package. This removes the legacy mcard-js dependency\noutright and reimplements everything that used it.\n\nDeleted (313 tracked files):\n- public/js/mcard/ (7 files) and packages/mcard/ (13 files)\n- public/js/vendor/mcard-js/ (292 files) and its 37 KB bundle\n- the mcard-js dependency in both package.json files\n\nAdded, on clm-kernel@0.0.1:\n- public/js/mcard-kernel/compat.js — presents the legacy API shape while every\n  operation is the kernel''s. Cards are wrapped rather than decorated because\n  kernel MCards are frozen; MCard.create, MCardCollection, detectMime and\n  AgentDid do the actual work.\n- public/js/mcard-kernel/indexeddb-backend.js — a real StorageBackend. There is\n  no published IndexedDB backend, and SqlJsBackend is unusable because the\n  published tarball ships no .wasm.\n- public/js/mcard-kernel/MCardManager.js, UIComponents.js — the app-facing\n  surface, reimplemented.\n- public/js/mcard-kernel/node-shims/ — the kernel''s ESM entry imports crypto,\n  fs, module, path, events, http and dgram unconditionally, so it cannot be\n  bundled for the browser as shipped. Functional where the work is pure string\n  or hash handling (including a real synchronous SHA-256); loud throws where the\n  API is genuinely Node-only.\n- server/mcard-api.mjs rebuilt on NodeSqliteBackend + MCard + detectMime.\n\nBehaviour change: DELETE now tombstones instead of removing the card row. The\nschema is a G-Set with an append-only card table (INV-REF-03), so the route\nreleases the handle mapping and retains the content, reporting which handles it\nreleased.\n\nAlso fixed: three separate import maps defined ''mcard-js'' independently (only\none was known); a fourth import in create-latex-card.html; and a fifth in the\nservice worker precaching mcard-js from unpkg.\n\nVerified: presentation spec 11/11 with zero module or runtime errors, and every\nAPI endpoint exercised (create, list, get, search, stats, tombstone, 404).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"96a52be13098972959ac275243a49c7d612b89ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/trees/96a52be13098972959ac275243a49c7d612b89ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/git/commits/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16219073?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benkoo","id":16219073,"login":"benkoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE5MDcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benkoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0","node_id":"C_kwDOQQQJA9oAKDYxN2I1OTFhZjhhMTE4ODRjZGY1NWRiYWNkYTliYjQ2NDAwZjdmYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xlp0/LandingPage/commit/3cd8d01f11d59808157d1cb3914da231e7cd7923","sha":"3cd8d01f11d59808157d1cb3914da231e7cd7923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/3cd8d01f11d59808157d1cb3914da231e7cd7923"}],"sha":"617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xlp0/LandingPage/commits/617b591af8a11884cdf55dbacda9bb46400f7fa0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://a